OL,3,GNEWSABody of newborn baby found on
OL,4,Ashoreline in Wales as police search for
OL,5,Amother
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe body of a newborn baby has been
OL,8,Ffound along a shoreline in north Wales.
OL,10,FNorth Wales Police have appealed for
OL,11,Fthe mother who may be "extremely
OL,12,Fvulnerable" to come forward.
OL,14,FA member of the public found the body
OL,15,Fon the Menai Strait shoreline near
OL,16,FSiliwen Road on Sunday shortly before
OL,17,F17:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
